"""Seeds derived from a text label.

Several scripts give each estimate its own random stream, seeded from the text of a label
(`zlib.crc32(label.encode())`). The labels were written in Italian when the results of the paper
were produced; they are now in English. To keep every random stream, and therefore every number,
identical, the seed is still computed from the original Italian text, which `legacy()` rebuilds
from the English one with the tables below (generated when this code was translated).
"""
